should not support empty attributes alone in a paragraph

```
{}
.
<p>{}</p>
```

should not support attributes alone in a paragraph (widow)

```
{.a}
.
<p>{.a}</p>
```

should not support attributes at the start of a paragraph (orphan)

```
text

{.a}
.
<p>text</p>
<p>{.a}</p>
```

should support an empty attribute group

```
*word*{}
.
<p><em>word</em></p>
```

should support multiple empty attribute groups

```
*word*{}{}
.
<p><em>word</em></p>
```

should support empty groups surrounding a non-empty group

```
*word*{}{.a}{}
.
<p><em class="a">word</em></p>
```


should support inline attributes on emphasis

```
*word*{.a}
.
<p><em class="a">word</em></p>
```

should support inline attributes on strong

```
**word**{.a}
.
<p><strong class="a">word</strong></p>
```

should support inline attributes on inline code

```
`code`{.a}
.
<p><code class="a">code</code></p>
```

should support inline attributes on links

```
[text](url){.a}
.
<p><a class="a" href="url">text</a></p>
```

should support inline attributes on images

```
![alt](url){.a}
.
<p><img class="a" src="url" alt="alt"></p>
```

should support empty attributes

```
*word*{}
.
<p><em>word</em></p>
```

should support whitespace-only attributes

```
*word*{ 	}
.
<p><em>word</em></p>
```

should support a single class shortcut

```
*word*{.a}
.
<p><em class="a">word</em></p>
```

should support a single id shortcut

```
*word*{#a}
.
<p><em id="a">word</em></p>
```

should support a single key-value pair

```
*word*{k=v}
.
<p><em k="v">word</em></p>
```

should support a quoted value

```
*word*{k="v w"}
.
<p><em k="v w">word</em></p>
```

should not support a single-quoted value

```
*word*{k='v w'}
.
<p><em>word</em></p>
```

should support attributes without values

```
*word*{a b c}
.
<p><em a="" b="" c="">word</em></p>
```

should support multiple classes (space-separated, joined)

```
*word*{.a .b .c}
.
<p><em class="a b c">word</em></p>
```

should support id overwrite (last wins)

```
*word*{#a #b}
.
<p><em id="b">word</em></p>
```

should support mixed shortcuts and key-value

```
*word*{.a #b k=v}
.
<p><em class="a" id="b" k="v">word</em></p>
```

should support two adjacent attribute groups (merged)

```
*word*{.a}{#b}
.
<p><em class="a" id="b">word</em></p>
```

should support three adjacent attribute groups (merged)

```
*word*{.a #a #b .c}{ k=v }{ m=n }
.
<p><em class="a c" id="b" k="v" m="n">word</em></p>
```

should merge classes across adjacent groups

```
*word*{.a}{.b}
.
<p><em class="a b">word</em></p>
```

should overwrite id across adjacent groups (last wins)

```
*word*{#a}{#b}
.
<p><em id="b">word</em></p>
```

should overwrite key-value across adjacent groups (last wins)

```
*word*{k=v}{k=w}
.
<p><em k="w">word</em></p>
```

should support full example from spec

```
here is a *word*{.a #a #b .c}{ k=v } which will be rendered as
.
<p>here is a <em class="a c" id="b" k="v">word</em> which will be rendered as</p>
```

should not support whitespace between attribute groups

```
*word*{.a} {#b}
.
<p><em class="a">word</em> {#b}</p>
```

should not support a newline between attribute groups

```
*word*{.a}
{#b}
.
<p><em class="a">word</em>
{#b}</p>
```

should not support a newline inside attributes

```
*word*{.a
#b}
.
<p><em>word</em>{.a
#b}</p>
```

should not support whitespace between element and attributes

```
*word* {.a}
.
<p><em>word</em> {.a}</p>
```

should not apply attributes to plain text (no preceding inline element)

```
word{.a}
.
<p>word{.a}</p>
```

should not support attributes on an unclosed emphasis

```
*word{.a}
.
<p>*word{.a}</p>
```

should support an escaped brace to prevent attributes

```
*word*\{.a}
.
<p><em>word</em>{.a}</p>
```

should not support attributes after a hard line break

```
*word*\
{.a}
.
<p><em>word</em><br>
{.a}</p>
```

should support attributes on nested emphasis (inner)

```
*a **b**{.x} c*
.
<p><em>a <strong class="x">b</strong> c</em></p>
```

should support attributes on nested emphasis (outer)

```
*a **b** c*{.x}
.
<p><em class="x">a <strong>b</strong> c</em></p>
```

should support attributes on both inner and outer

```
*a **b**{.y} c*{.x}
.
<p><em class="x">a <strong class="y">b</strong> c</em></p>
```

should support attributes on consecutive inline elements

```
*a*{.x} *b*{.y}
.
<p><em class="x">a</em> <em class="y">b</em></p>
```

should not support attributes attaching across a space

```
*a* *b*{.x}
.
<p><em>a</em> <em class="x">b</em></p>
```


